{"server":"tw","storyId":"act33side_level_act33side_st01","groupId":"act33side","stageId":"act33side_st01","title":"未完成的告別","storyCode":"BB-ST-1","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_st01.txt","sourceHash":"1fc3c3bff3e12d4e9b6e0424e1286442a464b8e8b7e779e32b6e2b42dc2d36f6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"男孩在夢中哭泣，女孩將男孩裹在自己抵擋風雪的斗篷中，為他拭去了眼淚。\n冰冷。斷續。呼嘯。\n巨人輕輕講述一部遙遠的史詩……\n她的聲音穿越了風雪的裂隙。\n眾魂的呼喚為其和音，男孩的嗚咽敲打著節拍。\n女孩在夢中的酷寒中微微喘息，她捂住了男孩的眼睛，然後閉上了眼。\n千年前的歌謠仍在他們眼前演繹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“這就是此章的結尾。”\n巨人淡入了夢中的風雪中，將孩子拋棄在身後。\n男孩漸漸不再聽到自己啼哭的聲音。\n他醒了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_thundercloud"},{"type":"narration","text":"1094年夏\n卡茲戴爾地區，荒廢小鎮外"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這就是此章的結尾，阿斯卡綸。我的故事說完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的族人……獨眼巨人深入北境前，最後望向卡茲戴爾的所見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這一章是已然逝去的未知歷史，是尚未臨近的可能未來，抑或是毫無意義的囈語？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"近千年來，無人知曉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直到他們出現，命運的湍流開始岔進更窄、更確定的河道……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在，她所見的命運，已經近在眼前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不關心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，難得你有耐心聽我說完。"},{"type":"narration","text":"紅色的鮮血慢慢沿著他的面具下沿滑落到了他的胸口。\n阿斯卡綸微微眯眼，他已走投無路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會死，所以我給你最後的尊重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳。呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從我們認識開始，你從未把那些個預言放在心上，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那……你永遠不會理解一個貪婪的人對控制命運的渴望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死前少廢話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你急著去和巴別塔那些人會合，但現在還沒到你走的時候。你看，天災快到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……我倒開始好奇了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在風暴之中，找到了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"委託必須完成，這是我自己在疤痕商場定下的規矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論生——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿斯卡綸的身形在他的背後消失，同一時間，薄暮般的霧氣已經繞緊巨人的脖頸，將他的身軀高懸於危崖之外。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你有看到過自己的結局嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我不在乎預言，和你一樣，哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但事實就是，我們都逃不開命運。你不想掙扎嗎？憑什麼？為什麼？怎麼能夠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要忘了，預言中也有你的一席之地——"},{"type":"narration","text":"嗚咽。風暴。\n哀婉的吟唱在他們的耳畔響起，來自女妖河谷的輓歌掠過地平，捲入風暴中央。\n阿斯卡綸的身體不由自主地戰慄著，她渾身冰涼。\n一陣無法訴說的刺痛從她的耳後一路激盪到腳底。\n沒有名字的輓歌，不祥的預兆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別了……卡茲戴爾。"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿斯卡綸聽到了一聲嘆息。\n她的手越握越緊，直到“疤眼”的喉嚨無法發出一絲輕微的聲音。\n然後，她鬆開了手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈，該死的命運。"},{"type":"narration","text":"眨眼間，獨眼巨人的巨大身體成了懸崖下一個渺小的點。\n薄霧在狂風中散去，連同兜帽投下的陰影一起，消失在墜落懸崖的淚水中。\n喘息聲，天災雲中低沉的雷鳴，風沙席捲荒地的呼嘯……\n萬物的聲音歸於沉寂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_victoria"},{"type":"narration","text":"維多利亞，倫蒂尼姆"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"屬於她的薩卡茲，抬起頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們還要履行她交予的使命，我就站在這裡，等你們上前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我准許你們為她復仇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刺殺者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刺殺者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的衣服上，繡了我的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刺殺者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是特蕾西婭殿下親自刺繡的，而它此刻正微微發燙，我知道……這意味著什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刺殺者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭殿下交給我們的任務已經結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刺殺者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不再向你舉劍。薩卡茲不會在外敵前刀劍相向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刺殺者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我們，向你效忠，攝政王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刺殺者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你仍然抱有對薩卡茲的熱忱，我們便甘願把性命交給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使你們險些毀掉了我們在維多利亞的一切布置？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刺殺者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果軍事委員會決定讓我們死，我們可以死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刺殺者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要這能帶來更好的結果……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刺殺者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那便如她所願。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們方才還是險些葬送計劃的叛黨頭目，讓我怎麼相信——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“如她所願”，是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的名字，劊子手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刺殺者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤莉葉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會記住你的名字，也會交給你最後的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"衛兵，刺客，傭兵，這場血戰的每一位倖存者——我要你們踏入諸王長眠之所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要你們拆碎維多利亞的鋼鐵心臟，在那裡伏擊並剿滅所有的蒸汽騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤莉葉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是軍事委員會削弱倫蒂尼姆的核心計劃，讓我們也參與？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德會看好你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤莉葉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是不是，不可能活著離開那裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大可去爭取。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤莉葉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……還有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤莉葉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是看看，是什麼樣的人培養出了阿斯卡綸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤莉葉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她始終沒有擺脫你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤莉葉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……在我發誓追隨特蕾西婭殿下時，從未想過那一對改寫了卡茲戴爾歷史的混血雙子的故事會如此落幕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤莉葉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更沒想到，原來我這種賤命胚子，也在這段故事之中有了一席之地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤莉葉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"永別了，特雷西斯殿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤莉葉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會把對你的憎恨，帶進墳墓。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡茲戴爾地區，巴別塔羅德島本艦"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"自誕生於世的那一天起，凱爾希從未感到這道長廊如此漫長。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（憤怒的嘶吼）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無名的刺客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，咳哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無名的刺客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勛爵……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無名的刺客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要安葬我們，卡茲戴爾的土地再不能容下更多叛徒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"了結他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭！博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（焦急的嘶鳴）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"系統無回應……這……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr，切開門！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（狂暴的嘶吼）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr，熔毀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不朽的帝國化為齏粉，神民的權杖在先民的呐喊中被折為兩段，天幕上浪湧般的脈衝，群星自璀璨閃耀到暗淡解體的不變規律……\n消亡，新生，萬物輪迴，於她從不陌生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（興奮的嘶吼）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希下意識地搜索腦海中的記憶……\n消亡，新生，萬物輪迴。\n不。\n這一次，不一樣。不太一樣。\n她第一次，必須與第一位能與她平等交流的摯友告別。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭……博士……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明知道這樣的可能性始終存在……為什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我應該留下，是我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
